{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24410","headline":"早春忆游思黯南庄因寄长句 · 白居易","name":"早春忆游思黯南庄因寄长句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南庄胜处心常忆，借问轩车早晚游。\n美景难忘竹廊下，好风争奈柳桥头。\n冰消见水多於地，雪霁看山尽入楼。\n若待春深始同赏，莺残花落却堪愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24410.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24410","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}